forums. This Go-written modular stealer exclusively targets macOS users with cryptocurrency holdings exceeding $10,000. Distribution occurs through ClickFix social engineering and malicious DMG files disguised as legitimate applications like WallSpace. The malware employs a modular architecture with specialized components to exfiltrate iMessage history, Apple Notes, browser credentials, Safari cookies, crypto wallet files, SSH keys, and cloud provider credentials. By social-engineering victims into granting Full Disk Access, notnullOSX bypasses macOS TCC protections without triggering permission dialogs. The stealer maintains persistent WebSocket connections to Firebase infrastructure, functioning as both an infostealer and backdoor with remote module update capabilities.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-04-15T15:41:20.824000","created":"2026-04-15T14:59:34.875000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"alh1mik","indicators":[{"id":3680763681,"indicator":"coockie.pro","type":"domain","created":"2026-04-15T14:59:35","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4032920021,"indicator":"83.217.209.88","type":"IPv4","created":"2026-04-15T14:59:35","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":"2026-05-15T14:00:00","is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4311805730,"indicator":"070402c2c531aa3a87b9ccd080532a51d17b01d982b205fc4487246d58de8913","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-15T14:59:35","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4311805731,"indicator":"4584d02b5193799453766857dba97021f966b9cbf6033d7dd3a33d61eb975a6c","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-15T14:59:35","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4311805732,"indicator":"47373950e1d23c066de0ed2d511b4b7eea56ec22d7b501db265995fec51dbb44","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-15T14:59:35","content":"","title":"","descripti